==Restrictions==
*Fixed lineup: [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Hevijak the Wicked (Uber Rare Cat)|Wicked King Hevijak]].

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
Upgrade your wallet to level 2. Then, wait until the first Those Guys get close to the base, then spam Wall Cats until the Dagshund gets close. Once the Dagshund gets close, spawn Crazed Bahamut Cat to take him out. Spawn Hevijak, then spam Macho Cat, Wall Cat and Sexy Legs Cat, and you should win.

==Hints==
The first hint can be viewed within the Enemies Appearing window before beginning the stage. The second only appears as a defeat message when failing it.
*Some bosses will not appear until<br>the enemy base is attacked.<br>Make sure to stock up on money before<br>punching through the enemy's forces.
*The boss of this stage won't appear<br>until the enemy base is attacked. Buy<br>some time and build up your Money to<br>take on the big threat lying in wait.

